    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.060" end="00:02.570" ttm:agent="v1">I've been M.I.A. so long, I think it's time to turn it on</p>
      <p begin="00:02.570" end="00:05.870" ttm:agent="v1">This passion in my body, ragin' on me like a quiet storm</p>
      <p begin="00:05.870" end="00:08.830" ttm:agent="v1">I've been stuck, surrounded by these losers, lames, and all above</p>
      <p begin="00:08.830" end="00:11.700" ttm:agent="v1">I can't fuck with that girl 'cause she said she don't know how to love</p>
      <p begin="00:11.700" end="00:14.830" ttm:agent="v1">Told you that you hurt me, I felt like I had to let you know</p>
      <p begin="00:14.830" end="00:17.810" ttm:agent="v1">Now you tryna pull up to my crib, I think you really gotta</p>
      <p begin="00:17.810" end="00:20.220" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Go, just go (ahh)</p>
      <p begin="00:20.220" end="00:23.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Go, just go (ahh)</p>
